      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ أُنْفُخَانٌ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنْفِخَانٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُنْفُخَانِىٌّ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنْفِخَانِىٌّ</span>, fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, (assumed tropical:)  <i>A man full of fat;</i> (K;)
<i>inflated with flaccid fat,</i> and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رحل مَنْفُوخٌ</span></b> ;
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْفُوخُوَن</span>. (TA.)

